# DEFINITIONS USED FOR MANUSCRIPT COUNTS:
# - DEG calls summed across contrasts: sum of the six per-contrast DEG counts;
#   a gene significant in multiple contrasts is counted once per contrast here.
# - Distinct DEGs: union of GeneIDs significant in at least one contrast.
# - Contrast-specific/unique DEG: significant in exactly one of the six contrasts.
# - Multi-contrast DEG: significant in more than one of the six contrasts.
# - Warm-cold-boundary DEG: a distinct DEG significant in TL_vs_AE or AL_vs_TE.
